sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Presenter
    participant App as Web App
    participant Eng as Engine
    participant Voice as Voice

    P->>App: Upload PDF + configure settings
    App->>App: Convert PDF → PNG slides
    P->>App: Click Start
    App->>Eng: Launch subprocess

    Eng->>Voice: Start mic listener
    Voice-->>Eng: MIC: READY

    loop Presentation
        P->>Eng: Pinch gesture
        Eng->>Eng: Navigate / Spotlight / Zoom

        P->>Voice: "computer next"
        Voice-->>Eng: cmd = "next"
        Eng->>Eng: Go to next slide
        Eng->>P: Updated slide display
    end

    P->>Eng: Press Q or say "computer quit"
    Eng->>Voice: stop()
    Eng->>P: Window closes
